    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>

    <h2>Introduction</h2>
    <p>
      Caponeu project consortium is committed to the protection of your personal data and respects your privacy on all pages within caponeu.eu domain. This privacy policy on the protection of individuals with regard to the processing of personal data is based on the Regulation (EU) 2018/1725. This privacy policy covers all URL’s on the caponeu.eu domain. 
    </p>
    <p>
      You can browse through most URL’s on caponeu.eu domain without giving any personal data.
    </p>
    <p>
      Personal data may be required for the provision of an e-service for Caponeu consortium team members with user accounts on caponeu.eu.  Personal data collected in this case is: Name, Last name, E-mail address. The purpose of collecting this data is to allow access for Caponeu consortium team members to project’s working materials. Personal data is processed only with the purpose to allow access to working materials for Caponeu consortium team members. Data is securely stored and kept until user account is deleted. Access to personal data is allowed only to Caponeu consortium team members. Further data processing or distribution is not allowed.
    </p>
    
    <h2>IP adress and device ID</h2>
    <p>
      When you access a page on caponeu.eu domain, the Caponeu project consortium receives as an essential technical requirement the Internet Protocol address (IP address) or the device ID of the device used to access the page. Without this information, you will not be able to establish a technical connection between your devices and the server infrastructure and therefore will not be able to access the pages in caponeu.eu domain. Caponeu project consortium only keeps this information for the time necessary to fulfil the request, namely for the duration of the browsing session. In addition, IP addresses and device IDs might be saved for one year in the log files of the servers used to host the pages.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      Pages on caponeu.eu domain do not use cookies.Some pages may provide links to third-party sites. In order to use third party content on our websites, you may need to accept their specific terms and conditions, including their cookie policies over which we have no control.
    </p>

    <h2>Traffic analytics</h2>
    <p>
      Pages on caponeu.eu domain use Open Source solution for traffic analytics, Matomo. Caponeu project consortium uses Matomo instance installed and maintained by Slobodna domena Zadruga za otvoreni kod i dizajn.  No personal data is logged for the purpose of traffic analytics. 
    </p>

    <h2>Your rights as a data subject</h2>
    <p>
      You have the right to obtain access to the personal data held by the Caponeu project consortium about you and to request its rectification or erasure, or restriction of processing or, where applicable, the right to object to processing or the right to data portability. Where the processing is based on your consent or explicit consent, you also have the right to withdraw your consent at any time, without affecting the lawfulness of processing based on consent before its withdrawal.
    </p>
    <p>
      For any request concerning the processing of your personal data, we invite you to contact the operational controller responsible at zadruga@slobodnadomena.hr.
    </p>
</section>
